# Aster — the viewer and the delivery packages it reads, in one tree.
#
# viewer/ and ticvai/ were separate repositories until 26 August. Their prior
# histories are not in here: they were moved to Desktop/atlas-prior-git/ intact
# rather than deleted, and Desktop/ticvai still holds the pre-split repository
# with its own remotes. This repository starts clean, by decision.

# --- installed, not authored -------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
viewer/public/build/

# --- build output ------------------------------------------------------------
# The .NET mirrors under ticvai/repos/ carry obj/ and bin/ from somebody's local
# build. They arrived in the 25 August dump as untracked directories and are
# regenerated by any build, so they are output rather than package.
obj/
bin/
backend/target/

# --- accounts, and the one file that must never leave this machine -----------
# viewer/api/ticvai.db holds real accounts: e-mail addresses, password hashes,
# live sessions and every verdict anybody has recorded. One of the remotes is a
# public GitHub repository, and TODO.md still carries V-04 — "change your
# password, it is in a public repo" — as an open item from the last time
# credentials were committed. Not again.
#
# The schema is created and backfilled at boot by viewer/api/db.py, so a fresh
# checkout builds an empty store on first run and needs nothing restored.
viewer/api/*.db
viewer/api/*.db-wal
viewer/api/*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- scratch -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# --- design drops, staged rather than delivered ---------------------------
# `ticvai/Updating old wireframes/` is the 26 August Claude Design drop. Its 32
# boards are installed in `ticvai/wireframes/` and tracked there; **148 of its
# 205 files are byte-identical duplicates of what is already committed.** The
# remaining 57 are 133 MB of PNG renders and uploads.
#
# Kept on disk, out of the repository, by decision: one of the remotes is a
# public GitHub repo, and 133 MB of duplicated renders is not package.
# Remove this line to commit it.
ticvai/Updating old wireframes/

# --- everything that lives at the root and is not a folder -------------------
# The root is a doormat: archives, GIF captures, handover notes and OneDrive
# exports get dropped there between sessions, and the largest so far was 263 MB.
# One of the remotes is a public GitHub repo, so a quarter-gigabyte of upload is
# not something to do by accident.
#
# The package is the folders — pitchdeck/, ticvai/, viewer/. Nothing loose at the
# root is package, so the root is ignored wholesale and the folders are let back
# in. A new top-level folder is tracked as before; a new top-level file is not,
# and needs a `!` line here or a home inside one of the folders.
/*
!/*/
!/.gitignore

# --- superseded screen definitions, and the review scaffolding over them ------
# The screen layer was rebuilt from the workshop packs on 9 September. The
# versions it replaced are kept — a regeneration that cannot be compared against
# what it replaced is one nobody can check — but they are not package: git HEAD
# already holds them, and a second copy in the tree would be two answers to the
# same question.
ticvai/_dump/
ticvai/_review-*/

# --- the connector setup zip, built from viewer/mcp by build-zip.ps1 ---------
# A build output, rebuilt whenever the connector changes and handed out by hand.
/adam-connector-setup.zip

# --- design and pitch material kept outside the repository -------------------
# Worked on locally in Claude Design; not part of the package or of ADAM.
/Mobile app design brief/
/pitchdeck/
# Video is too heavy for git. None is tracked; keep it that way.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
